                    "sense_definition": "present participle and gerund of <w>strut</w>",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "strutting_verb",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The peacocks were <w>strutting</w> around the courtyard, displaying their bright feathers.",
